> 
> 1. **Every change to a spec adds a decision.** A change to anything outside `## Changelog` comes
  "1." markup.list.numbered.markdown punctuation.definition.list.begin.markdown
  "**" markup.list.numbered.markdown meta.paragraph.markdown markup.bold.markdown punctuation.definition.bold.markdown
