  "`" markup.list.numbered.markdown meta.paragraph.markdown markup.inline.raw.string.markdown punctuation.definition.raw.markdown
>    with at least one new entry in the same change. The check in
>    `packages/reflect/deus/scripts/check-changelog.ts` enforces this in CI.
  "`" markup.list.numbered.markdown meta.paragraph.markdown markup.inline.raw.string.markdown punctuation.definition.raw.markdown
  "packages/reflect/deus/scripts/check-changelog.ts" markup.list.numbered.markdown meta.paragraph.markdown markup.inline.raw.string.markdown
  "`" markup.list.numbered.markdown meta.paragraph.markdown markup.inline.raw.string.markdown punctuation.definition.raw.markdown
> 2. **One decider per entry.** An entry is `by:` exactly one `user:` or `agent:`. Knowledge from
  "2." markup.list.numbered.markdown punctuation.definition.list.begin.markdown
  "**" markup.list.numbered.markdown meta.paragraph.markdown markup.bold.markdown punctuation.definition.bold.markdown
  "One decider per entry." markup.list.numbered.markdown meta.paragraph.markdown markup.bold.markdown
  "**" markup.list.numbered.markdown meta.paragraph.markdown markup.bold.markdown punctuation.definition.bold.markdown
  "`" markup.list.numbered.markdown meta.paragraph.markdown markup.inline.raw.string.markdown punctuation.definition.raw.markdown
  "by:" markup.list.numbered.markdown meta.paragraph.markdown markup.inline.raw.string.markdown
