> 5. **An agent entry names its principal.** `for:` is the person whose instruction the agent was
  "5." markup.list.numbered.markdown punctuation.definition.list.begin.markdown
  "**" markup.list.numbered.markdown meta.paragraph.markdown markup.bold.markdown punctuation.definition.bold.markdown
