> 6. **Approval is a decision.** A person who reviews and accepts agent entries makes a new
  "6." markup.list.numbered.markdown punctuation.definition.list.begin.markdown
  "**" markup.list.numbered.markdown meta.paragraph.markdown markup.bold.markdown punctuation.definition.bold.markdown
